graph TD
  C1["Client invocation sends a request<br/>optional, through call"]
  C2a["Response arrives: the transport wait ends. The handler<br/>continues, then required success work if still eligible"]
  C2b["Cancel or work deadline while awaiting: the runtime stops<br/>waiting and starts no later success hook. Code already running may go on"]
  L["Listener accepts and starts its own deadline,<br/>signal and terminal gate before any stage"]
  A1["Protected POST: credential verifier,<br/>body, then dependent tool work"]
  A2["Resource GET: capability, proof, replay,<br/>current entitlement, then storage. No person-auth or body"]
  G{"First to reach the gate"}
  R1["Work finishes:<br/>one response"]
  R2["Server deadline expires: one safe answer<br/>before commit, end or close after commit"]
  R3["Caller disconnects:<br/>no response"]
  Z["Late results are dropped<br/>no later stage starts"]
  K["Capability from an earlier request<br/>own expiry, not retracted"]
  Q["Acquisition with it is a new request<br/>new deadline, new checks, fresh proof"]
  N["Remote effects already made<br/>are not undone"]
  C1 -->|request sent| L
  L --> A1
  L --> A2
  A1 -->|each stage checks the gate| G
  A2 -->|each stage checks the gate| G
  G --> R1
  G --> R2
  G --> R3
  R1 --> Z
  R2 --> Z
  R3 --> Z
  C1 -.-> C2a
  C1 -.-> C2b
  C2b -.->|does not prove the server stopped| L
  C2b -.-> N
  K --> Q
  Q -.->|starts its own lifetime| L
